      "id": "dsh-engine",
      "name": "DeepSeek Harness Engine",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "description": "将 DeepSeek Harness 的完整 Agent 能力集成到 Polaris：工具链（bash/pwsh/fs）、子代理、工作流、目标、技能、MCP 客户端、用户审批。",
      "author": "Polaris Community",
